SUMMARY:SAPA Meeting - Christmas Party & Silent Auction
DESCRIPTION:Annual SAPA holiday party featuring a potluck dinner\, philatelic gift exchange\, and special recognition of volunteers and long-time members. Potluck dinner - bring a dish to share. Philatelic gift exchange - $15 maximum value. Spouses and family members welcome. Special recognition for 2025 volunteers. Doors open at 6:30 PM\, meeting begins at 7:00 PM.
